PREFIX schema: <https://schema.org/>
PREFIX xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#>

<https://linked.data.gov.au/org/nsw-dpe>
    a schema:Organization ;
    schema:description """The New South Wales Department of Planning and Environment (DPE) was a department of the New South Wales Government, responsible for effective and sustainable planning to support the growth in the state of New South Wales, Australia.

The department was renamed from the Department of Planning, Industry and Environment (DPIE) on 21 December 2021.

Superseding agencies: Department of Planning, Housing and Infrastructure & Department of Climate Change, Energy, the Environment and Water.""" ;
    schema:name "New South Wales Dept of Planning and Environment" ;
    schema:url "https://www.dpie.nsw.gov.au"^^xsd:anyURI ;
.
